30:Td9f,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How do I book a private taxi in Makkah?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Send your pickup, drop-off, date, passengers and luggage by the form or on WhatsApp. We reply with the vehicle and one fixed fare before anything is booked — no meter and no surge."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I book a private transfer from Jeddah Airport to Makkah?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Jeddah Airport (JED) to Makkah is about 80 km and ~1 hr. The driver meets you after baggage claim, we track your flight, and the first 15–30 minutes of waiting is free."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I travel privately from Makkah to Madinah?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Makkah to Madinah is about 430 km — ~4 hr of driving. A private car goes hotel to hotel with prayer and rest stops on request, and the return trip can be booked at the same time."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I request hotel pickup in Makkah?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Give us the hotel name and the driver comes to the entrance. Near Masjid al-Haram the car may have to wait at the nearest permitted point during prayer times; the driver tells you where."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I book Makkah Ziyarat transportation?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. A private car takes you between the sites you choose, such as Jabal al-Nour, Jabal Thawr, Mina, Muzdalifah and Arafat, and waits at each stop. We provide transport only, not religious guidance."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I hire a private driver by the hour in Makkah?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Book a car and driver for a block of hours or a full day; the car waits between stops. Send your date, start time and hours needed and we confirm the fare before booking."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which vehicle should I choose for my family?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A sedan fits individuals and couples with normal luggage. A GMC or full-size SUV, or a Hyundai Staria, suits families with more luggage. A Hiace van or coaster suits larger groups. We confirm the vehicle against your passenger and luggage count."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can you provide a GMC or a Hyundai Staria?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Both are in the vehicle categories available through our partner network. Availability is confirmed for your date, route and passenger count when we quote."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can you arrange a large bus for a group?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Coasters and larger coaches are arranged on request through our partner network. Send the group size, dates and routes and we confirm what is available."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I request corporate transportation in Makkah?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Email your company details and trip list for a written quote. Corporate invoicing can be arranged through our sister company."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I cancel or change a booking?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Cancellation is free up to 24 hours before pickup, and time or address changes can be made on WhatsApp."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do the drivers speak English?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Drivers in our partner network speak English and Arabic, and trips run 24 hours a day."}}]}29:["$","script","3",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$30"}}]
